244
00:17:56,499 --> 00:17:58,499
And these ladies would love to teach you!

245
00:17:59,499 --> 00:18:00,499
Not a chance!

246
00:18:01,499 --> 00:18:06,499
Sorry to disappoint, but I'm not here to be gal pals with your freaky little friends!

247
00:18:07,499 --> 00:18:11,499
I was born to love the most beautiful ladies in the world!

248
00:18:12,499 --> 00:18:13,499
Not...

249
00:18:14,499 --> 00:18:15,499
Yee-haw!

250
00:18:18,499 --> 00:18:23,499
Well, quirks aside, you've got guts, boy. I like you, so that means I'll give you a chance.

251
00:18:23,499 --> 00:18:24,499
Oh, yeah?

252
00:18:27,499 --> 00:18:29,499
But a chance is just a chance!

253
00:18:30,499 --> 00:18:34,499
Because I'll be giving the recipes to the 99 Grand Masters of New Kama Kenpo on this island!

254
00:18:35,499 --> 00:18:40,499
If you're half the man you think you are, you can defeat them and claim the recipes for yourself!

255
00:18:40,499 --> 00:18:49,499
Also, do not let your guard down, because every new Kama on the island will be trying to put this adorable dress on you!

256
00:18:50,499 --> 00:18:53,499
Hope you have fun protecting your fragile manhood!

257
00:18:56,499 --> 00:18:57,499
Oh, Sanjay!

258
00:18:58,499 --> 00:18:59,499
Say goodbye to sleeping!

259
00:19:00,499 --> 00:19:03,499
This sweet dress! If you've never worn one before, you're in for a treat!

260
00:19:04,499 --> 00:19:05,499
They're so breathable!

261
00:19:06,499 --> 00:19:07,499
Join us!

262
00:19:07,499 --> 00:19:08,499
It's nice to be girly.

263
00:19:11,499 --> 00:19:16,499
It's just you versus the island of New Kama Kenpo! Let's begin!

264
00:19:17,499 --> 00:19:22,499
If you can win this fight, I'll also throw in a ship! Not a bad deal, if you ask me.

265
00:19:23,499 --> 00:19:24,499
So what do you say, boy?

266
00:19:27,499 --> 00:19:30,499
So listen, Mr. Cook, why don't you leave this boat and join my crew?

267
00:19:32,499 --> 00:19:33,499
Huh?

268
00:19:33,499 --> 00:19:35,499
I could use a cook like you on my pirate ship!

269
00:19:37,499 --> 00:19:38,499
I'm not worried.

270
00:19:38,499 --> 00:19:39,499
Hmph.

271
00:19:39,499 --> 00:19:40,499
Because I don't think it's time for me to die just yet!

272
00:19:40,499 --> 00:19:41,499
I've seen one or two like him before.

273
00:19:41,499 --> 00:19:43,499
Stubborn kids who'd rather die than have to turn away from a fight once it's started.

274
00:19:44,499 --> 00:19:49,499
I don't believe I've heard an answer. Could it be that you've given up already?

275
00:19:49,499 --> 00:19:50,499
Well, if you quit, then win?

276
00:19:50,499 --> 00:19:51,499
When I win this?

277
00:19:51,499 --> 00:19:52,499
Huh?

278
00:19:52,499 --> 00:19:53,499
When I finish beating all of them?

279
00:19:53,499 --> 00:19:54,499
I bet I'll be a whole lot stronger than I am now.

280
00:19:54,499 --> 00:19:55,499
I bet I'll be a whole lot stronger than I am now.

281
00:19:55,499 --> 00:19:56,499
Even with a hundred thousand more weapons, I'll be a whole lot stronger than I am now.

282
00:19:56,499 --> 00:19:57,499
Even with a hundred thousand more weapons, our chore boy will win.

283
00:19:57,499 --> 00:19:58,499
I'll be a whole lot stronger than I am now.

284
00:19:58,499 --> 00:20:03,499
Even with a hundred thousand more weapons, I'll be a whole lot stronger than I am now.

285
00:20:03,499 --> 00:20:04,499
I don't believe I've heard an answer.

286
00:20:04,499 --> 00:20:05,499
I don't believe I've heard an answer.

287
00:20:05,499 --> 00:20:06,499
Could it be that you've given up already?

288
00:20:06,499 --> 00:20:07,499
Well, if you quit, then win...

289
00:20:07,499 --> 00:20:20,499
When I win this, when I finish beating all of them, I bet I'll be a whole lot stronger

290
00:20:20,499 --> 00:20:21,499
than I am now.

291
00:20:21,499 --> 00:20:27,499
Even with a hundred thousand more weapons, our chore boy can still bring him to his knees

292
00:20:27,499 --> 00:20:30,499
because he does not know fear.

293
00:20:30,499 --> 00:20:35,619
Hey, Luffy, hang in there just a little while longer.

294
00:20:37,059 --> 00:20:41,519
I promised myself that one of these days, I'll go to the Grand Line.

295
00:20:42,119 --> 00:20:43,639
Well, let's go right now!

296
00:20:43,679 --> 00:20:45,839
It just isn't the right time, not yet.

297
00:20:48,259 --> 00:20:50,439
Say, have you ever heard of the All-Blue?

298
00:20:51,079 --> 00:20:51,539
No.

299
00:20:52,039 --> 00:20:55,059
You've got to be kidding me. That sea is a miracle.

300
00:20:58,699 --> 00:21:00,259
Your dream is foolish.

301
00:21:00,759 --> 00:21:01,919
Then again, so's mine.

302
00:21:04,039 --> 00:21:05,959
Now is as good a time as any.

303
00:21:06,339 --> 00:21:08,219
Why not start my quest right now?

304
00:21:09,119 --> 00:21:09,559
Sanji.

305
00:21:10,119 --> 00:21:14,099
I'll be joining your little crew on your journey to be King of the Pirates.

306
00:21:15,939 --> 00:21:17,459
Do you hear me, Luffy?

307
00:21:17,779 --> 00:21:19,339
I want to be your cook.

308
00:21:21,519 --> 00:21:23,959
Luffy, when we meet again,

309
00:21:23,959 --> 00:21:27,059
you'll see.

310
00:21:27,059 --> 00:21:31,519
I'll be the best damn chef in all of the New World.

311
00:21:31,519 --> 00:21:34,819
I'll make food fit for the King of the Pirates.

312
00:21:34,819 --> 00:21:37,699
Until then,

313
00:21:37,699 --> 00:21:41,019
I must survive

314
00:21:41,019 --> 00:21:43,779
this hell.

315
00:21:47,619 --> 00:21:49,939
I accept your challenge.

316
00:21:49,939 --> 00:21:52,899
Now give me your worst.

317
00:21:54,899 --> 00:21:55,639
That's better.

318
00:21:56,399 --> 00:21:58,599
Remember, we're not going easy on you.

319
00:21:58,939 --> 00:22:00,219
Just shut up and fight.

320
00:22:00,399 --> 00:22:01,579
You heard him, lady.

321
00:22:01,899 --> 00:22:03,079
Go to town!

322
00:22:03,079 --> 00:22:05,839
Hey, Sanji!

323
00:22:05,839 --> 00:22:09,079
Oh, don't give me the cold shoulder!

324
00:22:09,619 --> 00:22:10,299
Cannon!

325
00:22:10,299 --> 00:22:11,699
How feisty!

326
00:22:15,419 --> 00:22:16,699
Pull it together.

327
00:22:17,079 --> 00:22:18,239
I can't lose yet.

328
00:22:18,419 --> 00:22:19,419
Not to you.

329
00:22:19,419 --> 00:22:21,079
That wasn't nice.

330
00:22:24,139 --> 00:22:25,259
That wasn't nice.

331
00:22:32,639 --> 00:22:37,319
Luffy, both of us are getting through this no matter what it takes.

332
00:22:37,799 --> 00:22:40,299
So, I heard you're fighting me for my recipe.

333
00:22:40,959 --> 00:22:42,399
Well, Caroline is ready.

334
00:22:42,859 --> 00:22:44,279
Come and get it if you dare.

335
00:22:45,379 --> 00:22:46,839
This is convenient.

336
00:22:46,839 --> 00:22:51,659
After that last battle we had, I owe you a proper beatdown.

337
00:22:53,739 --> 00:22:55,359
Here I come!

338
00:22:57,199 --> 00:23:00,219
Make no mistake, I will win!

339
00:23:09,879 --> 00:23:15,119
With their reunion on hold, each member of the Straw Hat crew finds a new goal to strive for.

340
00:23:15,119 --> 00:23:18,119
Thankfully, their surroundings are ripe with opportunity.

341
00:23:18,119 --> 00:23:24,119
Determined to push forward into the new world, they vow to show their captain a new strength the next time they meet.

342
00:23:24,119 --> 00:23:28,119
On the next One Piece, I will get much, much stronger!

343
00:23:28,119 --> 00:23:33,119
Zoro's pledged to his captain, I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

